; Zen gather/scatter costs when AVX512VL is unavailable.
;
; The narrow EVEX encodings need AVX512VL. Without it, an operation whose data
; and index both fit below 512 bits has no narrow form to use, so CodeGen widens
; it to the 512-bit instruction and masks off the surplus lanes. The cost of
; such a shape must therefore reflect the full-width instruction that is really
; emitted; it must not fall back to a flat cost cheaper than the narrow form it
; cannot use.
;
; Shapes that already need a 512-bit operand -- a v8i32 gather with 64-bit
; indices uses a full zmm of indices -- do not require AVX512VL and must be
; unaffected.

